      <key>com.lihbr.kuronuri.source</key>
      <string>Drawn, the loop form: Redaction Italic o's left side as an arc open at the top, its end carried over and cut as ω's arms, and its right side as a bowl that arches over into p's stem, cut plain at its descender as ρ's and β's; a ledge in the stem under the arch on the right, and one over the foot of the bowl on the left</string>
    </dict>
  </lib>
